# Mudlib LPC

Write to the **rmudos subset** in `docs/LPC.md` and efuns in `docs/EFUNS.md`. This is not a full FluffOS lib.

## Boot contract

- `/secure/master` must define `create`, `preload`, and `connect`.
- `preload` loads rooms (or other world objects) via `load_object`.
- `connect` returns a cloned user object (`clone_object("/std/user")`).
- User objects should define `logon` and `process_input(string line)` (return `0` to quit).
- Rooms typically `inherit "/std/room"` and set extras in `create`.

## Language limits

No `#include`, no simul_efun, no `save_object` yet, no `catch`. Use `//` and `/* */` comments. Declare locals at the start of the function. Paths are `/foo/bar` without `.c`.

If you need a new language feature or efun for the mudlib, implement it in the driver first, then use it here. Do not assume MudOS-only efuns exist.

Keep commands in `/std/user` small and consistent with `docs/MUDLIB.md`.
